1
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:29,946
TAKE CHARGE OF MY HEART

2
00:01:10,862 --> 00:01:12,739
Secretary Yoon, you traitor…

3
00:01:12,822 --> 00:01:14,449
What did you just say?

4
00:01:15,492 --> 00:01:17,327
What happened?

5
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:21,915
What happened to your face?

6
00:01:23,833 --> 00:01:25,752
I guess it means

7
00:01:26,795 --> 00:01:28,213
I'm not the traitor here.

8
00:01:38,681 --> 00:01:42,143
Did you lock them up?
Keep them there until the event's over.

9
00:01:42,644 --> 00:01:44,646
Avoid direct contact with Na Bo-bae.

10
00:01:44,729 --> 00:01:45,688
Yes, sir.

11
00:01:45,772 --> 00:01:47,941
There are no electronic devices
near her, right?

12
00:01:48,024 --> 00:01:49,442
Of course.

13
00:01:50,193 --> 00:01:53,154
There's nothing here,
only rocks and trees.

14
00:01:53,238 --> 00:01:55,198
Don't worry. Just go on in.

15
00:01:55,782 --> 00:01:58,159
Understood, Director. Yes, sir.

16
00:02:01,037 --> 00:02:01,871
D

17
00:02:01,955 --> 00:02:04,249
MR. BAEK IS ON HIS WAY
TO THE TS 30TH ANNIVERSARY PARTY

18
00:02:04,332 --> 00:02:05,542
NA BO-BAE AND YOON JAE-HO…

19
00:02:10,255 --> 00:02:12,966
NA BO-BAE AND YOON JAE-HO ARE BEING HELD
ON DIRECTOR CHOI'S ORDERS

20
00:02:42,453 --> 00:02:44,956
The door won't open. What do we do?

21
00:02:45,999 --> 00:02:47,750
Damn it. We don't have our phones.

22
00:02:48,251 --> 00:02:50,628
Manager Yoon, what are you doing?

23
00:02:53,173 --> 00:02:56,009
My little sister is here.

24
00:02:58,553 --> 00:02:59,387
Sorry?

25
00:03:00,263 --> 00:03:03,683
This is where the memorial tablets
for Mr. Baek's parents are kept.

26
00:03:05,476 --> 00:03:06,686
My sister

27
00:03:07,812 --> 00:03:08,813
is here too.

28
00:03:11,941 --> 00:03:13,359
They locked us in here.

29
00:03:15,111 --> 00:03:17,280
Director Choi must be behind this.

30
00:03:18,156 --> 00:03:19,574
Your sister

31
00:03:21,201 --> 00:03:22,493
passed away?

32
00:03:40,094 --> 00:03:41,763
It's okay, Jae-ho.

33
00:03:41,846 --> 00:03:44,599
My mom and dad sent them.
They're worried about me.

34
00:03:44,682 --> 00:03:47,268
Oh, really?

35
00:03:47,352 --> 00:03:49,437
Okay, let's try this one.

36
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,438
Yeah!

37
00:03:51,231 --> 00:03:54,901
Jae-yeong was first in line
for a heart transplant,

38
00:03:54,984 --> 00:03:57,111
but the TS chairman's grandson
took her place.

39
00:03:57,195 --> 00:04:01,032
-My goodness.
-Those TS bastards!

40
00:04:01,115 --> 00:04:04,118
Jae-yeong died because of them!

41
00:04:04,869 --> 00:04:09,457
Jae-yeong was first in line.

42
00:04:21,177 --> 00:04:22,011
Get lost.

43
00:04:23,137 --> 00:04:26,015
Don't you know Jae-yeong died
because of you?

44
00:04:26,099 --> 00:04:27,517
You think money is everything?

45
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:29,102
It wasn't because of me.

46
00:04:29,185 --> 00:04:30,895
My dad told me.

47
00:04:30,979 --> 00:04:35,149
Jae-yeong was supposed to
get the heart transplant.

48
00:04:36,276 --> 00:04:37,610
But you took it from her.

49
00:04:38,111 --> 00:04:40,530
No, I have an artificial heart.

50
00:04:41,781 --> 00:04:44,534
-I'm not getting a heart transplant.
-What?

51
00:04:44,617 --> 00:04:46,536
Professor Jang told me

52
00:04:47,203 --> 00:04:49,747
your sister got sick
before she could get a transplant.

53
00:04:50,832 --> 00:04:53,167
He said that's why she went to heaven.

54
00:04:53,668 --> 00:04:55,461
It wasn't because of me.

55
00:04:55,545 --> 00:04:58,006
The ones who died because of me

56
00:04:58,089 --> 00:05:00,008
were my mom and dad.

57
00:05:00,508 --> 00:05:02,719
Not your sister.

58
00:05:03,303 --> 00:05:04,512
So

59
00:05:05,096 --> 00:05:07,932
Jae-yeong was going to die anyway?

60
00:05:09,267 --> 00:05:10,810
That's not fair.

61
00:05:11,561 --> 00:05:12,812
She was only 9.

62
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,024
Mom…

63
00:05:20,445 --> 00:05:22,196
The day I lost my sister,

64
00:05:22,822 --> 00:05:24,949
Mr. Baek lost his parents.

65
00:05:27,994 --> 00:05:29,537
I was just a boy.

66
00:05:30,621 --> 00:05:32,123
I thought Mr. Baek and I

67
00:05:33,041 --> 00:05:35,001
had been brought together by fate.

68
00:05:35,793 --> 00:05:38,796
We both lost family on the same day.

69
00:05:39,881 --> 00:05:41,632
We were together when it happened.

70
00:05:53,478 --> 00:05:55,688
Ms. Na Bo-bae, why are you crying?

71
00:05:55,772 --> 00:05:57,899
It's just so sad.

72
00:05:59,609 --> 00:06:00,943
I feel so bad

73
00:06:01,861 --> 00:06:05,114
for your sister, Mr. Baek, and you.

74
00:06:06,657 --> 00:06:09,535
I'm sorry for suspecting you.

75
00:06:25,218 --> 00:06:26,552
Are you all right?

76
00:06:26,636 --> 00:06:29,514
I'll wash your handkerchief
and give it back.

77
00:06:31,307 --> 00:06:33,226
These pockets are sewn shut.

78
00:06:34,018 --> 00:06:35,603
Give it to me later.

79
00:06:35,686 --> 00:06:37,730
I'll wash it and give it back.

80
00:06:37,814 --> 00:06:39,357
Just throw it away.

81
00:06:43,361 --> 00:06:44,487
We need to hurry.

82
00:06:44,570 --> 00:06:47,698
I haven't seen Mr. Baek since morning.
He needs a charge.

83
00:06:48,282 --> 00:06:51,327
As far as I know, he's good for 25 hours.

84
00:06:51,411 --> 00:06:53,121
Or at least 24.

85
00:06:53,204 --> 00:06:56,082
Yes, but I've got a bad feeling.

86
00:06:56,165 --> 00:06:58,126
We should hurry and get out of here.

87
00:07:24,026 --> 00:07:26,529
Seriously? I ordered it ages ago!

88
00:07:27,572 --> 00:07:31,117
Yes, turn right at the intersection
and keep going.

89
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,827
You'll see a temple.

90
00:07:34,287 --> 00:07:37,248
Secretary Lee! Over here!

91
00:07:37,331 --> 00:07:39,584
Manager Yoon, are you all right?

92
00:07:41,961 --> 00:07:43,045
I'm sorry about this.

93
00:07:43,754 --> 00:07:47,758
Just to be clear, I don't have
anything personal against either of you.

94
00:07:47,842 --> 00:07:51,179
I'm just a lowly employee
earning a paycheck.

95
00:07:51,262 --> 00:07:55,725
I had no choice but to follow orders
and bring you here.

96
00:07:59,979 --> 00:08:01,522
I had my suspicions,

97
00:08:01,606 --> 00:08:03,983
but I can't believe
Secretary Lee was a spy.

98
00:08:05,401 --> 00:08:06,777
All this time,

99
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:10,448
you were a spy planted by Director Choi?

100
00:08:11,032 --> 00:08:12,033
Yeah, pretty much.

101
00:08:12,617 --> 00:08:15,244
I happen to need a lot of money.

102
00:08:16,662 --> 00:08:17,997
It pays to play both sides.

103
00:08:20,082 --> 00:08:21,292
Are you telling me

104
00:08:21,792 --> 00:08:24,212
you were also spying for Director Han?

105
00:08:24,295 --> 00:08:27,048
They say it's easy to miss
what's right under your nose.

106
00:08:27,882 --> 00:08:30,760
Today's probably the day, don't you think?

107
00:08:32,178 --> 00:08:34,388
Since Choi Do-yoon and Han Seol-hee

108
00:08:34,472 --> 00:08:36,474
are both with Mr. Baek now.

109
00:08:36,557 --> 00:08:40,645
Secretary Lee, what are you talking about?

110
00:08:40,728 --> 00:08:43,397
It means today's probably the end

111
00:08:43,481 --> 00:08:45,066
for Mr. Baek.

112
00:08:45,149 --> 00:08:46,317
What?

113
00:08:46,984 --> 00:08:47,902
The end?

114
00:08:48,986 --> 00:08:49,946
Secretary Lee.

115
00:08:50,029 --> 00:08:52,198
You fucking bastard!

116
00:08:52,281 --> 00:08:55,076
Oh dear.
There's that temper of yours again.

117
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:59,038
I'm too scared to even talk to you now.

118
00:08:59,121 --> 00:09:02,500
-Lee!
-His whole family's in there, right?

119
00:09:02,583 --> 00:09:04,043
When Mr. Baek passes,

120
00:09:04,126 --> 00:09:07,296
I'll place his memorial tablet
right next to his family's.

121
00:09:08,047 --> 00:09:08,881
Open the door.

122
00:09:10,424 --> 00:09:11,592
Open the door!

123
00:09:11,676 --> 00:09:13,594
You won't get away with this!

124
00:09:21,727 --> 00:09:22,770
Ms. Na Bo-bae?

125
00:09:23,563 --> 00:09:24,438
Why is…

126
00:09:24,522 --> 00:09:25,815
Ms. Na Bo-bae?

127
00:09:27,316 --> 00:09:29,110
What's going on?

128
00:09:30,069 --> 00:09:31,195
What's happening?

129
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:32,238
Damn it.

130
00:09:33,656 --> 00:09:34,490
Ow, it's hot!

131
00:09:38,035 --> 00:09:39,036
Ms. Na Bo-bae?

132
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:41,622
Why is everyone always out to get him?

133
00:09:43,291 --> 00:09:44,959
What did he ever do to anyone?

134
00:09:48,212 --> 00:09:49,839
Ms. Na Bo-bae, are you okay?

135
00:09:50,881 --> 00:09:53,009
Buddha, Avalokiteśvara.

136
00:09:53,092 --> 00:09:55,303
Please forgive this poor soul
just this once.

137
00:09:59,265 --> 00:10:00,349
What are you doing?

138
00:10:00,433 --> 00:10:01,601
Metal is a conductor.

139
00:10:03,394 --> 00:10:05,521
And so is this lock.

140
00:10:06,105 --> 00:10:07,607
A strong current

141
00:10:07,690 --> 00:10:09,358
will make it spark.

142
00:10:17,450 --> 00:10:19,118
What the hell is this?

143
00:10:19,201 --> 00:10:22,580
I'm gonna get electrocuted.
I need to stay calm.

144
00:10:23,581 --> 00:10:24,665
What is this?

145
00:10:24,749 --> 00:10:26,167
Secretary Na! What the hell?

146
00:10:26,250 --> 00:10:28,836
When did you… Stop! You'll break the door!

147
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:31,839
I can't let you out, Secretary Na!

148
00:10:31,922 --> 00:10:33,215
Ow, it's hot!

149
00:10:33,883 --> 00:10:35,009
Fire!

150
00:10:35,092 --> 00:10:37,511
It's on fire! It's hot!

151
00:10:38,721 --> 00:10:40,348
This is on fire too!

152
00:10:44,352 --> 00:10:45,978
Fire!

153
00:10:47,355 --> 00:10:48,397
Get them! Hurry!

154
00:10:48,481 --> 00:10:49,815
What are you doing? Hurry!

155
00:10:51,525 --> 00:10:52,443
I'm sorry.

156
00:10:53,569 --> 00:10:54,654
Ms. Na Bo-bae!

157
00:10:56,656 --> 00:10:58,532
Stop them!

158
00:11:06,374 --> 00:11:07,375
Ms. Na Bo-bae?

159
00:11:16,676 --> 00:11:19,553
Our car's not here.
I think these are all theirs.

160
00:11:24,266 --> 00:11:25,643
I'm here with a delivery.

161
00:11:25,726 --> 00:11:28,312
Did the temple really order fried chicken?

162
00:11:28,396 --> 00:11:29,689
Oh, yes.

163
00:11:29,772 --> 00:11:31,732
Just keep going straight up.

164
00:11:31,816 --> 00:11:34,068
Okay. Thank you.

165
00:11:40,574 --> 00:11:41,826
Excuse me.

166
00:11:41,909 --> 00:11:43,661
This is for you.

167
00:11:44,161 --> 00:11:45,663
Feel free to contact me.

168
00:11:45,746 --> 00:11:47,456
You must be in a hurry.

169
00:11:48,124 --> 00:11:49,041
Go ahead.

170
00:11:57,258 --> 00:11:58,509
Excuse me!

171
00:11:58,592 --> 00:12:01,262
Excuse me! Wait! Hey!

172
00:12:05,891 --> 00:12:09,395
And now,
to mark TS Group's 30th anniversary,

173
00:12:09,478 --> 00:12:13,524
we'll hear from each division head
about their achievements.

174
00:12:14,024 --> 00:12:18,571
Let's welcome Senior Managing Director
Baek Ho-rang from TS Resort to the stage.

175
00:12:35,337 --> 00:12:36,922
Go faster!

176
00:12:42,970 --> 00:12:45,431
First, I'd like to…

177
00:12:50,186 --> 00:12:55,566
thank you all for joining us
to celebrate TS Group's 30th anniversary.

178
00:13:57,169 --> 00:13:59,129
Call an ambulance.

179
00:14:00,381 --> 00:14:03,300
No photos. No photos, please!

180
00:14:04,593 --> 00:14:06,595
Out of the way. Step back.

181
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:08,097
No photos!

182
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:09,431
-Mr. Baek Ho-rang!
-Sir!

183
00:14:11,392 --> 00:14:12,726
No photos!

184
00:14:13,227 --> 00:14:14,144
Sir!

185
00:14:14,645 --> 00:14:16,522
Mr. Baek Ho-rang?

186
00:14:18,274 --> 00:14:19,149
No.

187
00:14:19,233 --> 00:14:21,402
-Don't die. Breathe, please.
-Hey, you!

188
00:14:21,485 --> 00:14:24,280
-Put that camera down! No photos!
-Please clear the area!

189
00:14:24,363 --> 00:14:25,948
-Please leave!
-Please step back.

190
00:14:26,031 --> 00:14:27,324
-Step back!
-No photos!

191
00:14:27,408 --> 00:14:29,410
-Step back now.
-No.

192
00:14:29,493 --> 00:14:30,661
Don't die.

193
00:14:30,744 --> 00:14:31,996
Don't die on me.

194
00:14:32,079 --> 00:14:33,038
Please.

195
00:14:44,633 --> 00:14:46,927
Let's go. Come on.

196
00:14:47,636 --> 00:14:48,804
Let's get out of here.

197
00:14:52,808 --> 00:14:53,642
Please.

198
00:14:54,518 --> 00:14:55,728
Please…

199
00:14:56,437 --> 00:15:00,149
Take everything I have.
Just wake up, please!

200
00:15:19,627 --> 00:15:21,253
Baek Ho…

201
00:15:25,674 --> 00:15:26,508
Sir.

202
00:15:27,217 --> 00:15:28,677
Sir?

203
00:15:29,678 --> 00:15:30,846
Sir.

204
00:16:16,684 --> 00:16:18,310
Are you out of your mind?

205
00:16:18,811 --> 00:16:20,688
Have you completely lost it?

206
00:16:20,771 --> 00:16:21,605
What?

207
00:16:22,439 --> 00:16:24,316
Worried Baek Ho-rang might die?

208
00:16:25,234 --> 00:16:27,486
Did you spike his drink to kill him?

209
00:16:54,263 --> 00:16:55,723
Sir.

210
00:17:06,483 --> 00:17:07,484
Seol-hee.

211
00:17:08,402 --> 00:17:09,361
Han Seol-hee.

212
00:17:10,154 --> 00:17:11,864
Don't act all innocent.

213
00:17:12,573 --> 00:17:16,035
We're on the same team.
Why do you think I kidnapped Na Bo-bae?

214
00:17:16,702 --> 00:17:18,871
You think I did it
to bring her to Baek Ho-rang?

215
00:17:18,954 --> 00:17:20,706
I told you to keep her away from him.

216
00:17:21,290 --> 00:17:22,708
Why did you have to hurt him?

217
00:17:22,791 --> 00:17:23,709
You will never

218
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:27,004
take Na Bo-bae's place.

219
00:17:27,504 --> 00:17:29,506
Baek Ho-rang will die without Na Bo-bae.

220
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:31,091
You saw it yourself.

221
00:17:31,175 --> 00:17:32,885
Na Bo-bae saved Baek Ho-rang.

222
00:17:33,802 --> 00:17:36,764
That woman is Baek Ho-rang's battery.

223
00:17:38,474 --> 00:17:41,143
-What the hell are you talking about?
-You didn't know?

224
00:17:41,810 --> 00:17:43,020
Na Bo-bae

225
00:17:43,103 --> 00:17:45,731
can generate electricity.

226
00:17:46,648 --> 00:17:47,608
Zap!

227
00:17:48,609 --> 00:17:49,443
Are you drunk?

228
00:18:04,333 --> 00:18:05,959
Man, what the hell is going on?

229
00:18:06,710 --> 00:18:09,213
Mr. Baek was taken to the hospital.

230
00:18:09,296 --> 00:18:11,215
They even performed CPR on him.

231
00:18:12,382 --> 00:18:14,384
Our ads won't be affected, right?

232
00:18:15,094 --> 00:18:17,763
Someone collapsed,
and you're worried about the ad?

233
00:18:17,846 --> 00:18:21,141
Come on, he's our client.
Of course I'm worried.

234
00:18:21,225 --> 00:18:22,142
Oh, Director.

235
00:18:22,226 --> 00:18:23,519
-Hello.
-Why are you…

236
00:18:24,103 --> 00:18:26,688
Oh, right.
We said we'd discuss the script, right?

237
00:18:26,772 --> 00:18:28,190
-Yes.
-Sorry, I forgot.

238
00:18:28,273 --> 00:18:30,609
I just need to make a quick call
about Writer Na.

239
00:18:30,692 --> 00:18:32,402
You mean Writer Na Bo-bae?

240
00:18:33,445 --> 00:18:34,446
Did something happen?

241
00:18:34,530 --> 00:18:35,405
Just a sec.

242
00:18:36,198 --> 00:18:37,533
What's going on?

243
00:18:48,210 --> 00:18:49,920
Director Han Seol-hee?

244
00:19:00,180 --> 00:19:01,014
It must be hard.

245
00:19:02,599 --> 00:19:07,062
They say misfortune comes all at once,
but this is a bit much, isn't it?

246
00:19:07,896 --> 00:19:08,730
Sorry?

247
00:19:08,814 --> 00:19:11,316
You've been through a lot lately.

248
00:19:12,067 --> 00:19:13,277
Didn't you find it odd?

249
00:19:14,403 --> 00:19:18,657
One misfortune after another,
as if the whole world were against you.

250
00:19:20,284 --> 00:19:22,494
What are you talking about?

251
00:19:22,578 --> 00:19:25,289
I've learned that with money, power,

252
00:19:25,372 --> 00:19:27,166
and enough malice,

253
00:19:27,749 --> 00:19:29,751
you can make bad things happen.

254
00:19:33,839 --> 00:19:36,884
I could become your misfortune,
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

255
00:19:38,343 --> 00:19:39,928
SHOCKING IDENTITY OF JI EUN-HO'S GIRL

256
00:19:40,012 --> 00:19:43,182
Editing and spreading the video
of you and Ji Eun-ho.

257
00:19:43,265 --> 00:19:47,394
Helping you land a commercial,
securing a slot for your drama…

258
00:19:47,477 --> 00:19:49,104
We're dropping Writer Na's drama?

259
00:19:49,188 --> 00:19:50,814
Orders from the top. Sorry.

260
00:19:51,607 --> 00:19:54,318
…and then canceling it
when you thought you'd made it.

261
00:19:59,323 --> 00:20:01,158
My drama got canceled?

262
00:20:01,783 --> 00:20:03,994
You didn't know? You'll get a call soon.

263
00:20:05,037 --> 00:20:05,996
That reminds me.

264
00:20:06,079 --> 00:20:07,956
Your brother got hurt recently, right?

265
00:20:13,086 --> 00:20:16,632
It wasn't a coincidence that your brother
ended up in the hospital.

266
00:20:17,257 --> 00:20:19,968
Yes. I just took care of it.

267
00:20:20,469 --> 00:20:22,638
I made sure not to hit him too hard.

268
00:20:22,721 --> 00:20:24,306
But I feel really guilty.

269
00:20:25,599 --> 00:20:27,100
I'll make it worth your while.

270
00:20:29,019 --> 00:20:29,853
Thank you.

271
00:20:43,075 --> 00:20:44,284
You do realize

272
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:47,788
that everything you just said
is a crime, right?

273
00:20:47,871 --> 00:20:49,665
-If I report you to the--
-Go ahead.

274
00:20:50,249 --> 00:20:51,541
It's okay.

275
00:20:51,625 --> 00:20:53,126
I have an expensive lawyer.

276
00:20:54,753 --> 00:20:56,922
I know people like you very well, Ms. Na.

277
00:20:57,839 --> 00:21:00,968
People who chase their dreams
over money or power.

278
00:21:01,677 --> 00:21:03,845
Love, hope,

279
00:21:03,929 --> 00:21:05,097
justice.

280
00:21:06,098 --> 00:21:08,267
People who like
that kind of sentimental stuff.

281
00:21:09,768 --> 00:21:11,561
I can give you all that.

282
00:21:13,605 --> 00:21:14,731
Luck, not misfortune.

283
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:18,986
As long as you disappear
from Mr. Baek's life.

284
00:21:19,861 --> 00:21:22,990
Why should I leave Mr. Baek
because of someone like you?

285
00:21:25,659 --> 00:21:27,953
Because the one who should be by his side

286
00:21:29,329 --> 00:21:30,622
is me.

287
00:21:31,623 --> 00:21:33,500
I can help him.

288
00:21:34,084 --> 00:21:35,419
But you, Ms. Na Bo-bae?

289
00:21:36,378 --> 00:21:40,590
I have your whole life under my control.

290
00:21:41,758 --> 00:21:43,552
What can you even do for him?

291
00:21:55,814 --> 00:21:58,525
Wow, you're something else.

292
00:21:59,026 --> 00:22:01,445
So this is what you're really like.

293
00:22:02,237 --> 00:22:06,575
You see, writers like me go crazy
for people like you.

294
00:22:07,826 --> 00:22:11,621
A backstabbing character with a twist.
So three-dimensional.

295
00:22:12,456 --> 00:22:15,959
I never saw it coming.
You're interesting, to say the least.

296
00:22:16,918 --> 00:22:19,921
-Don't you understand what's going on?
-I understand perfectly.

297
00:22:21,673 --> 00:22:23,050
No wonder.

298
00:22:23,133 --> 00:22:26,595
Everything was going so well,
then suddenly, it all fell apart.

299
00:22:27,179 --> 00:22:30,390
Yeah, someone orchestrated all this.

300
00:22:31,308 --> 00:22:32,351
But who?

301
00:22:33,810 --> 00:22:36,605
This pretty, sweet,

302
00:22:36,688 --> 00:22:39,024
demure, angelic little princess.

303
00:22:40,025 --> 00:22:42,986
Would you mind
if I wrote a character based on you?

304
00:22:43,070 --> 00:22:45,739
You're trying so hard
to pretend you're okay.

305
00:22:47,449 --> 00:22:50,077
I'm curious to see
how long you can keep it up.

306
00:22:51,078 --> 00:22:52,954
I don't even know what I'm capable of.

307
00:23:12,516 --> 00:23:13,850
Manager Yoon.

308
00:23:22,192 --> 00:23:23,151
Are you all right?

309
00:23:25,195 --> 00:23:26,029
Yes.

310
00:23:27,030 --> 00:23:30,117
I'd never done anything like that.
They said I passed out from exhaustion.

311
00:23:32,369 --> 00:23:34,246
He's still in surgery?

312
00:23:34,329 --> 00:23:36,039
Why is it taking so long?

313
00:23:36,623 --> 00:23:37,624
Don't worry.

314
00:23:40,252 --> 00:23:41,128
Mr. Baek is…

315
00:23:43,046 --> 00:23:45,424
He's your rubber glove of fate, right?

316
00:23:51,096 --> 00:23:52,013
He'll be all right.

317
00:23:54,724 --> 00:23:55,809
I hope so.

318
00:23:56,643 --> 00:23:58,103
SURGERY OVER

319
00:24:08,822 --> 00:24:10,449
Doctor, how is Mr. Baek Ho-rang?

320
00:24:11,783 --> 00:24:13,577
The surgery went well.

321
00:24:15,370 --> 00:24:16,788
Thank you, Professor.

322
00:24:16,872 --> 00:24:19,624
Ms. Na Bo-bae, can I have a word with you?

323
00:24:21,626 --> 00:24:24,045
I'll leave you two to it, then.

324
00:24:24,129 --> 00:24:25,464
Thank you.

325
00:24:28,884 --> 00:24:31,261
What's wrong? Did something happen?

326
00:24:31,344 --> 00:24:33,263
No, the surgery went well.

327
00:24:34,014 --> 00:24:36,308
We replaced his artificial heart battery

328
00:24:36,391 --> 00:24:39,394
and confirmed it can hold its charge
after closing him up.

329
00:24:39,478 --> 00:24:42,689
He can move to a regular ward
after a few days in intensive care.

330
00:24:45,150 --> 00:24:46,735
Then why did you want to…

331
00:24:47,402 --> 00:24:52,240
You came in with Ho-rang a while back
and had some tests done, remember?

332
00:24:52,324 --> 00:24:55,202
-Yes.
-I checked your medical records.

333
00:24:55,285 --> 00:24:57,996
You were hospitalized here before,
weren't you?

334
00:24:58,997 --> 00:25:01,291
Back then,
when you regained consciousness,

335
00:25:01,374 --> 00:25:02,209
you said

336
00:25:02,876 --> 00:25:05,337
you felt electricity
running through your body.

337
00:25:05,837 --> 00:25:06,963
Is that true?

338
00:25:08,340 --> 00:25:09,257
Yes.

339
00:25:09,341 --> 00:25:15,514
If Ho-rang's battery was charged
by the electricity running through you,

340
00:25:16,890 --> 00:25:17,933
I'm afraid

341
00:25:18,517 --> 00:25:19,684
you two

342
00:25:20,352 --> 00:25:23,772
can't have any more physical contact.

343
00:25:26,691 --> 00:25:28,610
Why not?

344
00:25:29,736 --> 00:25:34,032
I heard Ho-rang's battery was at 0%
before he was brought in tonight.

345
00:25:35,867 --> 00:25:38,328
That means the electricity
running through you

346
00:25:38,411 --> 00:25:40,455
was enough to revive him
from cardiac arrest.

347
00:25:40,956 --> 00:25:45,752
Another strong current flowing through him
could overload his artificial heart.

348
00:25:58,473 --> 00:25:59,933
This means

349
00:26:00,850 --> 00:26:02,018
that you could end up

350
00:26:03,645 --> 00:26:05,564
killing Ho-rang.

351
00:26:17,534 --> 00:26:18,868
It's strange.

352
00:26:21,621 --> 00:26:24,958
So many terrible things
have happened to me lately.

353
00:26:27,919 --> 00:26:30,255
But more than the drama getting canceled,

354
00:26:31,381 --> 00:26:34,342
or my brother getting hurt because of me,

355
00:26:35,677 --> 00:26:38,722
or all that trouble
caused by the rumors about Eun-ho and me…

356
00:26:41,391 --> 00:26:43,768
seeing Mr. Baek lying there
hurts the most.

357
00:26:55,697 --> 00:26:57,240
Now, if he touches me,

358
00:26:58,033 --> 00:26:59,618
he could die.

359
00:27:01,911 --> 00:27:02,996
No.

360
00:27:03,747 --> 00:27:07,250
Just walking into his room
could cause something to go wrong.

361
00:27:09,669 --> 00:27:12,213
Just like my life,
which has gone completely wrong.

362
00:28:03,139 --> 00:28:04,391
It's okay.

363
00:28:07,602 --> 00:28:10,855
It's not like my life
has ever gone smoothly.

364
00:28:14,567 --> 00:28:16,861
Nothing ever works out for me.

365
00:28:19,114 --> 00:28:21,491
And I was always alone anyway.

366
00:28:30,125 --> 00:28:31,543
CHARGING CONTRACT

367
00:28:38,800 --> 00:28:43,179
I was going to end up alone again anyway.

368
00:28:50,770 --> 00:28:52,063
So it's okay.

369
00:29:01,156 --> 00:29:02,073
Bo-bae.

370
00:29:04,200 --> 00:29:05,410
What are you doing here?

371
00:29:05,493 --> 00:29:08,288
I was worried about you,
so I went to the hospital.

372
00:29:08,371 --> 00:29:10,665
They told me
Mr. Baek was still unconscious,

373
00:29:10,749 --> 00:29:12,584
and you'd already been discharged.

374
00:29:14,586 --> 00:29:16,713
Director Yeom told me about your drama.

375
00:29:17,714 --> 00:29:18,548
Yeah.

376
00:29:19,132 --> 00:29:20,383
It's been canceled.

377
00:29:24,596 --> 00:29:25,513
Going somewhere?

378
00:29:26,347 --> 00:29:27,432
Just

379
00:29:28,933 --> 00:29:30,351
somewhere away from here.

380
00:29:30,435 --> 00:29:32,729
Your old place? Or back with your parents?

381
00:29:32,812 --> 00:29:33,646
Eun-ho…

382
00:29:35,482 --> 00:29:36,983
could you move?

383
00:29:37,776 --> 00:29:39,444
Where are you going?

384
00:29:40,695 --> 00:29:42,155
You're not giving up, are you?

385
00:29:42,238 --> 00:29:43,490
Wait, Bo-bae. Just wait.

386
00:29:44,866 --> 00:29:46,034
I'll do your drama.

387
00:29:46,534 --> 00:29:48,787
I spoke with Director Yeom about it.

388
00:29:48,870 --> 00:29:52,081
If we start casting and get a time slot
with my name on it…

389
00:29:52,165 --> 00:29:53,666
Don't do that.

390
00:29:54,334 --> 00:29:56,795
I'm not doing it anymore.
It doesn't matter.

391
00:29:58,379 --> 00:29:59,964
How can you say that?

392
00:30:00,548 --> 00:30:01,925
It's your drama.

393
00:30:02,425 --> 00:30:04,594
You're so close to your dream debut.

394
00:30:05,678 --> 00:30:06,805
How can it not matter?

395
00:30:06,888 --> 00:30:07,972
Just…

396
00:30:12,060 --> 00:30:13,478
Just let me go.

397
00:30:13,561 --> 00:30:15,939
Just leave me alone, please.

398
00:30:25,990 --> 00:30:26,991
I won't stop you.

399
00:30:28,618 --> 00:30:29,619
I'm sorry.

400
00:30:31,996 --> 00:30:34,332
Just do what your heart wants.

401
00:30:35,750 --> 00:30:36,793
Do that.

402
00:30:38,336 --> 00:30:39,671
That's all I'm asking.

403
00:31:08,449 --> 00:31:11,619
The video of Mr. Baek collapsing
is spreading fast.

404
00:31:11,703 --> 00:31:15,999
There are rumors about his health,
family illness, and even heart disease.

405
00:31:16,082 --> 00:31:18,251
There are also articles
about Ms. Na Bo-bae.

406
00:31:18,334 --> 00:31:21,087
First, get all the videos
and articles taken down.

407
00:31:21,170 --> 00:31:24,591
Then compile a list of every outlet
that published them.

408
00:31:24,674 --> 00:31:28,219
Pull our ads from those outlets.
Or sue for defamation.

409
00:31:28,303 --> 00:31:29,137
Get it done.

410
00:31:29,721 --> 00:31:30,847
Yes, ma'am.

411
00:31:32,307 --> 00:31:33,433
Is that girl

412
00:31:33,933 --> 00:31:35,351
Ho-rang's girlfriend?

413
00:31:35,435 --> 00:31:36,394
Oh.

414
00:31:37,020 --> 00:31:37,937
No.

415
00:31:39,063 --> 00:31:42,734
She was only with him
to help recharge his heart.

416
00:31:42,817 --> 00:31:45,945
How should I put it?
She's sort of a heart-care specialist.

417
00:31:46,029 --> 00:31:48,907
The surgery went well.
They won't be seeing each other again.

418
00:31:49,824 --> 00:31:51,409
Tomorrow morning,

419
00:31:51,993 --> 00:31:54,078
leak that Choi Do-yoon is the heir to TS.

420
00:31:55,538 --> 00:31:58,541
It's too risky to go with Ho-rang
right now.

421
00:31:59,167 --> 00:32:01,127
Yes, ma'am.

422
00:32:17,310 --> 00:32:18,269
Sir.

423
00:32:18,895 --> 00:32:20,188
You're awake.

424
00:32:20,688 --> 00:32:22,231
The surgery went well.

425
00:32:22,815 --> 00:32:23,983
It's been four days.

426
00:32:31,574 --> 00:32:32,492
Where's Ms. Na?

427
00:32:37,288 --> 00:32:38,331
Sir, no.

428
00:32:38,831 --> 00:32:40,792
You need to lie down.

429
00:32:41,292 --> 00:32:42,835
Sir, please.

430
00:32:46,673 --> 00:32:47,924
That can't be right.

431
00:32:49,258 --> 00:32:50,927
Why would Ms. Na Bo-bae…

432
00:32:52,345 --> 00:32:54,347
-Where would she go?
-I don't know.

433
00:32:54,430 --> 00:32:57,642
The house and garage are empty.
It seems she changed her number too.

434
00:32:57,725 --> 00:32:59,143
Sir, please.

435
00:32:59,686 --> 00:33:00,561
Move.

436
00:33:01,145 --> 00:33:03,439
Sir, please! Sir!

437
00:33:05,274 --> 00:33:06,359
Sir!

438
00:33:06,442 --> 00:33:10,071
Hey, why are you walking around?
You should be in bed!

439
00:33:10,154 --> 00:33:12,031
Why can't I be with Ms. Na?

440
00:33:12,115 --> 00:33:14,158
It could be dangerous, okay?

441
00:33:14,242 --> 00:33:16,786
It could put a strain on your heart.

442
00:33:18,705 --> 00:33:22,166
That's just one possibility.

443
00:33:22,250 --> 00:33:23,876
One possibility?

444
00:33:24,377 --> 00:33:28,297
If there's even a 1% chance
it could put your life at risk,

445
00:33:28,381 --> 00:33:30,299
then it's a no!

446
00:34:30,234 --> 00:34:34,489
CHARGING CONTRACT

447
00:34:40,953 --> 00:34:42,080
Just because of that…

448
00:34:44,373 --> 00:34:46,667
she left without saying anything?

449
00:34:54,634 --> 00:34:55,468
Sir.

450
00:34:57,637 --> 00:34:59,514
Did you find out where she went?

451
00:34:59,597 --> 00:35:01,349
I asked around.

452
00:35:01,891 --> 00:35:03,851
She isn't at the TV station.

453
00:35:04,352 --> 00:35:06,020
Her drama got canceled.

454
00:35:09,273 --> 00:35:11,984
Hire an investigator or call the police.

455
00:35:12,860 --> 00:35:14,362
Do whatever it takes to find her.

456
00:35:18,407 --> 00:35:20,910
Sir, you need to rest.

457
00:35:22,870 --> 00:35:25,289
We can look for Ms. Na Bo-bae anytime.

458
00:35:25,373 --> 00:35:27,375
You don't need to charge anymore.

459
00:35:28,209 --> 00:35:30,253
Take it easy.

460
00:35:34,632 --> 00:35:35,550
No.

461
00:35:36,926 --> 00:35:37,844
Forget it.

462
00:35:38,678 --> 00:35:40,388
I'll find her myself.

463
00:35:46,519 --> 00:35:48,771
I told you,
she won't even answer my calls.

464
00:35:48,855 --> 00:35:52,859
I get why she's upset it got canceled.
She worked on it for three years.

465
00:35:52,942 --> 00:35:56,154
But I didn't expect her to disappear.
I'm upset about it too.

466
00:35:56,237 --> 00:35:59,490
So you have no idea
where she might have gone?

467
00:35:59,574 --> 00:36:00,825
Not a clue.

468
00:36:00,908 --> 00:36:02,034
Bo-bae?

469
00:36:03,077 --> 00:36:06,038
I'm not sure.
I haven't really been in touch with her.

470
00:36:06,122 --> 00:36:07,415
Why?

471
00:36:07,498 --> 00:36:08,666
Did she go somewhere?

472
00:36:08,749 --> 00:36:10,626
You really don't know where she is?

473
00:36:12,503 --> 00:36:15,173
Oh, I should get back to work.

474
00:36:15,256 --> 00:36:17,925
Yeah, I have to head back.

475
00:36:18,009 --> 00:36:20,636
If I hear from Bo-bae,

476
00:36:21,637 --> 00:36:24,599
I'll tell her to call you.
Bye now, take care.

477
00:36:41,824 --> 00:36:45,494
Excuse me. They moved out.

478
00:36:46,204 --> 00:36:47,038
Sorry?

479
00:36:47,121 --> 00:36:49,123
The older sister's getting married,

480
00:36:49,707 --> 00:36:52,293
and her brother went home
to look after their parents.

481
00:36:52,376 --> 00:36:54,503
No one lives there now.

482
00:37:40,174 --> 00:37:41,342
Okay.

483
00:37:42,051 --> 00:37:44,428
I will save you, Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

484
00:37:57,191 --> 00:37:58,943
You said you would save me.

485
00:38:04,448 --> 00:38:05,366
I

486
00:38:06,867 --> 00:38:08,744
feel like I'm going to die right now.

487
00:38:16,127 --> 00:38:17,628
Where are you?

488
00:38:20,131 --> 00:38:21,507
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

489
00:38:37,440 --> 00:38:38,524
Why's it so dark?

490
00:38:38,607 --> 00:38:40,693
Na Bo-bae!

491
00:38:41,944 --> 00:38:42,945
Hey.

492
00:38:43,612 --> 00:38:45,072
Na Bo-bae, are you okay?

493
00:38:45,156 --> 00:38:46,866
Yeah. I didn't see you.

494
00:38:46,949 --> 00:38:50,286
What the… Hey, you spilled all the water.

495
00:38:50,995 --> 00:38:53,539
Are you okay? Did you eat anything today?

496
00:38:54,248 --> 00:38:56,042
Why are you standing here in the dark?

497
00:38:56,125 --> 00:38:57,626
Oh, sorry.

498
00:38:59,128 --> 00:39:01,088
Is this because of Baek Ho-rang?

499
00:39:02,506 --> 00:39:04,967
No. It's not like that.

500
00:39:08,596 --> 00:39:10,848
-Actually, earlier--
-I'll clean this up.

501
00:39:13,601 --> 00:39:15,728
It's okay. Give it here, I'll do it.

502
00:39:20,149 --> 00:39:21,650
Are you okay?

503
00:39:21,734 --> 00:39:23,444
I should be asking you that.

504
00:39:23,527 --> 00:39:25,029
Get some rest. I'll do it.

505
00:39:25,112 --> 00:39:27,615
-But our hands just--
-Quiet, you. Seriously.

506
00:39:28,366 --> 00:39:31,243
Go on in and rest. I'll clean this up.

507
00:39:31,327 --> 00:39:34,163
Don't think about anything.
Just go to sleep, okay?

508
00:39:34,997 --> 00:39:38,042
Don't worry about anything.
I'll clean this up.

509
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:41,045
Just now…

510
00:39:42,671 --> 00:39:44,840
Why didn't she get zapped?

511
00:40:06,529 --> 00:40:09,657
It's Seo-jeong.
I'm sorry for calling this late.

512
00:40:23,170 --> 00:40:24,505
Na Bo-bae!

513
00:40:25,005 --> 00:40:27,341
I know you're here. Open the door.

514
00:40:28,717 --> 00:40:31,554
The studio was a lie,
and so was the contract renewal.

515
00:40:31,637 --> 00:40:35,015
You quit the drama
and ran off to stay with Seo-jeong?

516
00:40:35,099 --> 00:40:36,559
And on top of all that,

517
00:40:36,642 --> 00:40:38,436
you've been living with a guy?

518
00:40:38,519 --> 00:40:40,146
Are you out of your mind?

519
00:40:40,229 --> 00:40:41,939
Well? Say something.

520
00:40:42,940 --> 00:40:45,568
How could you lie
to your own brother and sister?

521
00:40:45,651 --> 00:40:47,778
You always talk big and…

522
00:40:50,656 --> 00:40:51,824
Why are you crying?

523
00:40:51,907 --> 00:40:53,534
You think I'll go easy on you?

524
00:40:56,245 --> 00:40:57,413
Hey now.

525
00:40:57,955 --> 00:41:00,666
Why are you crying?
Did some jerk give you a hard time?

526
00:41:01,417 --> 00:41:04,003
-Which fucking bastard--
-Ji-hye, I…

527
00:41:05,171 --> 00:41:06,297
I feel weird.

528
00:41:07,673 --> 00:41:10,926
I don't feel like myself.

529
00:41:11,802 --> 00:41:14,930
I don't know what to do about him,

530
00:41:15,014 --> 00:41:17,224
and my electricity thing suddenly stopped.

531
00:41:17,308 --> 00:41:18,559
I…

532
00:41:19,310 --> 00:41:21,312
I think something's wrong with me.

533
00:41:21,395 --> 00:41:22,521
Wait, what?

534
00:41:22,605 --> 00:41:25,357
I know this thing has a mind of its own,

535
00:41:25,441 --> 00:41:28,277
but I don't know why I'm like this now.

536
00:41:28,360 --> 00:41:30,571
What if I get worse?

537
00:41:30,654 --> 00:41:33,741
I'm already a monster.
What if I turn into an even bigger--

538
00:41:33,824 --> 00:41:35,743
A monster? Don't be ridiculous.

539
00:41:36,911 --> 00:41:38,287
Calm down. Okay?

540
00:41:39,038 --> 00:41:42,166
You're not sure
when your electricity thing stopped?

541
00:41:50,174 --> 00:41:53,677
The TS Resort 30th Anniversary
Rebranding Ceremony will begin shortly.

542
00:41:53,761 --> 00:41:54,970
BAEK HO-RANG

543
00:41:56,597 --> 00:41:59,058
-Still no word from Mr. Baek?
-No.

544
00:41:59,141 --> 00:42:01,101
Please proceed to your seats.

545
00:42:13,697 --> 00:42:19,954
And now, we will begin the TS Resort
30th Anniversary Rebranding Ceremony.

546
00:42:20,037 --> 00:42:24,750
First, we'd like to introduce
the new brand ambassador of TS Resort.

547
00:42:25,334 --> 00:42:28,212
Actor Ji Eun-ho,
one of today's most sought-after stars,

548
00:42:28,295 --> 00:42:31,423
known for his sophisticated style
and refined presence,

549
00:42:31,507 --> 00:42:34,385
will now make his official debut
as the new face of TS Resort.

550
00:42:34,468 --> 00:42:37,680
Members of the press, this is your moment.

551
00:42:37,763 --> 00:42:40,516
Mr. Ji, would you mind
posing for the cameras?

552
00:42:40,599 --> 00:42:42,309
First, look to your right.

553
00:42:42,393 --> 00:42:44,687
Next, please look to the center.

554
00:42:44,770 --> 00:42:47,690
That concludes
Mr. Ji Eun-ho's photo session.

555
00:42:48,274 --> 00:42:52,444
Now, we'll hear a few words
from TS Resort's senior managing director.

556
00:42:52,945 --> 00:42:54,989
Sorry. He's running a bit late, so…

557
00:42:57,533 --> 00:42:59,827
Yes, well…

558
00:43:00,327 --> 00:43:05,040
TS Resort's senior managing director
isn't here right now,

559
00:43:05,624 --> 00:43:08,294
so we'll move on to the next item.

560
00:43:08,377 --> 00:43:10,713
First, we'll take a look

561
00:43:10,796 --> 00:43:13,549
at the promotional video
for TS Resort's rebranding…

562
00:43:35,946 --> 00:43:37,239
I'm not too late, am I?

563
00:43:38,657 --> 00:43:42,161
I'm Choi Do-yoon,
TS Resort's new senior managing director.

564
00:43:48,042 --> 00:43:52,338
Everyone, let's welcome him
with a big round of applause.

565
00:43:52,421 --> 00:43:54,423
A big round of applause, please.

566
00:43:56,759 --> 00:43:57,760
Chairwoman.

567
00:43:58,802 --> 00:44:01,555
Chairwoman.

568
00:44:08,479 --> 00:44:09,521
Right now,

569
00:44:10,564 --> 00:44:14,693
Senior Managing Director Baek Ho-rang
is still recovering.

570
00:44:14,777 --> 00:44:16,904
-If you give him more time--
-How long?

571
00:44:18,072 --> 00:44:19,865
How much longer do I have to wait?

572
00:44:20,574 --> 00:44:21,408
Chairwoman.

573
00:44:21,492 --> 00:44:24,745
I'd rather have a brat who knows
what he wants and never lets go

574
00:44:24,828 --> 00:44:28,123
than a weakling who walks away
from his responsibilities.

575
00:44:29,291 --> 00:44:31,710
Leave. I have nothing more to say.

576
00:44:47,351 --> 00:44:50,437
Tomorrow's our first meeting.
How exciting!

577
00:44:50,521 --> 00:44:53,565
Sincerely yours, TS Resort's
Senior Managing Director Choi Do-yoon.

578
00:45:00,656 --> 00:45:03,158
Who picked this painting?

579
00:45:03,242 --> 00:45:05,494
Wow, talk about tacky.

580
00:45:06,078 --> 00:45:08,706
I told them to put a rug down.

581
00:45:08,789 --> 00:45:10,916
There are so many gorgeous carpets
out there.

582
00:45:10,999 --> 00:45:12,876
-But this?
-Shouldn't you be at the hotel?

583
00:45:12,960 --> 00:45:14,086
Hey!

584
00:45:14,169 --> 00:45:16,380
Do you know how much that vase costs?

585
00:45:16,463 --> 00:45:18,841
-I'm sorry. I'll be careful.
-Seriously.

586
00:45:20,968 --> 00:45:23,971
Now that you're the boss,
we should overhaul the place.

587
00:45:24,054 --> 00:45:28,767
Not just the office.
I really don't like this whole TS Resort.

588
00:45:28,851 --> 00:45:31,437
I'm redoing the lobby and terrace.
Just so you know.

589
00:45:32,104 --> 00:45:33,063
Go ahead.

590
00:45:34,648 --> 00:45:39,570
You need to make sure
everyone knows TS Resort belongs to you.

591
00:45:40,237 --> 00:45:41,488
Manager Yoon.

592
00:45:42,781 --> 00:45:43,615
Yes?

593
00:45:47,119 --> 00:45:48,829
What's next for TS Resort?

594
00:45:50,247 --> 00:45:51,081
Well…

595
00:45:51,999 --> 00:45:52,833
Secretary Kim.

596
00:45:54,251 --> 00:45:56,086
I'm the senior managing director now.

597
00:45:56,712 --> 00:45:59,798
What was TS Resort's next project?

598
00:46:05,596 --> 00:46:11,477
We were preparing an Asia-wide partnership
with Sterling Group, a global hotel chain.

599
00:46:11,560 --> 00:46:12,561
Sterling?

600
00:46:15,397 --> 00:46:18,859
Baek Ho-rang really picked
the best of the bunch.

601
00:46:19,359 --> 00:46:20,694
Okay.

602
00:46:20,778 --> 00:46:21,945
You can go.

603
00:46:27,701 --> 00:46:28,869
Hey, Secretary Kim.

604
00:47:08,826 --> 00:47:09,827
What are you doing?

605
00:47:14,706 --> 00:47:16,250
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

606
00:47:23,632 --> 00:47:25,676
Aren't you surprised to see me here?

607
00:47:26,718 --> 00:47:28,262
Weren't you looking for me?

608
00:47:35,602 --> 00:47:36,562
I keep seeing you…

609
00:47:38,772 --> 00:47:39,773
in my dreams.

610
00:47:43,819 --> 00:47:45,070
I know this is…

611
00:47:48,073 --> 00:47:49,074
just another dream.

612
00:47:51,034 --> 00:47:52,411
You're no fun.

613
00:47:53,328 --> 00:47:55,080
I'll just leave, then.

614
00:48:05,257 --> 00:48:06,508
Don't go.

615
00:48:22,733 --> 00:48:24,443
You look awful.

616
00:48:26,570 --> 00:48:27,738
Are you hurting that badly?

617
00:48:29,615 --> 00:48:30,490
Yes.

618
00:48:31,909 --> 00:48:33,035
I don't think…

619
00:48:35,120 --> 00:48:37,164
I've ever been in this much pain.

620
00:49:14,701 --> 00:49:16,787
I told you, you can't go in!

621
00:49:18,872 --> 00:49:22,125
Sir, I saw it was Director Han,
so I opened the door.

622
00:49:22,209 --> 00:49:25,087
Then she suddenly asked
where you were, and I…

623
00:49:25,629 --> 00:49:27,506
It's okay. You can go.

624
00:49:27,589 --> 00:49:28,632
Yes, sir.

625
00:49:31,843 --> 00:49:34,054
You look awful,
Senior Managing Director Baek.

626
00:49:34,596 --> 00:49:37,516
Oh, wait. You're not
Senior Managing Director anymore,

627
00:49:38,016 --> 00:49:38,850
Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

628
00:49:39,768 --> 00:49:40,894
Please leave.

629
00:49:40,978 --> 00:49:43,772
Don't tell me you're like this
just because Na Bo-bae is gone.

630
00:49:43,855 --> 00:49:45,732
Don't you dare say her name.

631
00:49:51,780 --> 00:49:56,743
Are you really going to let Choi Do-yoon
take TS Resort from you?

632
00:50:04,167 --> 00:50:06,712
I don't care about the resort
or anything else.

633
00:50:07,754 --> 00:50:08,630
Leave now.

634
00:50:09,840 --> 00:50:13,719
How can you just give up everything
like this?

635
00:50:14,511 --> 00:50:18,598
You told me we become stronger
when we do our best to protect ourselves.

636
00:50:18,682 --> 00:50:20,684
You said that. Don't you remember?

637
00:50:20,767 --> 00:50:22,310
No, I don't.

638
00:50:23,311 --> 00:50:24,521
Just stop.

639
00:50:25,814 --> 00:50:28,984
Whenever things got hard,
I remembered what you said and held on.

640
00:50:31,737 --> 00:50:33,363
I can help you

641
00:50:35,157 --> 00:50:36,700
build the TS you want.

642
00:50:39,828 --> 00:50:41,705
I want you.

643
00:50:44,708 --> 00:50:46,293
Please look at me.

644
00:50:49,588 --> 00:50:50,422
This is

645
00:50:52,299 --> 00:50:54,426
what I'm thinking right now.

646
00:50:55,719 --> 00:50:57,596
"I wish the person in front of me

647
00:50:58,346 --> 00:51:00,015
were Ms. Na Bo-bae,

648
00:51:00,932 --> 00:51:02,893
not Director Han."

649
00:51:06,229 --> 00:51:07,230
Where did she go?

650
00:51:10,776 --> 00:51:12,861
Why did she leave so suddenly?

651
00:51:14,446 --> 00:51:15,739
I miss her.

652
00:51:17,324 --> 00:51:18,408
I'm angry

653
00:51:19,576 --> 00:51:20,744
and frustrated.

654
00:51:24,706 --> 00:51:26,875
Ever since I was struck by lightning,

655
00:51:26,958 --> 00:51:29,419
I've been dreaming about this day.

656
00:51:30,128 --> 00:51:32,881
The day my electrical power
suddenly goes away.

657
00:51:33,632 --> 00:51:36,051
I'd go back to being normal,

658
00:51:36,635 --> 00:51:38,470
and everyone would be happy for me.

659
00:52:00,200 --> 00:52:01,284
But

660
00:52:02,202 --> 00:52:05,205
am I really back to being normal?

661
00:52:32,649 --> 00:52:34,151
SIR, YOU SHOULD SEE THIS

662
00:52:45,704 --> 00:52:47,164
Where is Ji Eun-ho right now?

663
00:52:50,750 --> 00:52:51,960
Let's go.

664
00:52:58,675 --> 00:53:00,760
Who the hell drives like that
in a parking lot?

665
00:53:00,844 --> 00:53:02,012
Jesus, that scared me.

666
00:53:03,305 --> 00:53:06,933
Wow, that was impressive driving.
Hello, Mr. Baek.

667
00:53:12,898 --> 00:53:15,358
-Hee-chan, I need a moment.
-Sure thing.

668
00:53:15,442 --> 00:53:17,861
But try to keep it brief.

669
00:53:31,499 --> 00:53:33,793
Do you know

670
00:53:35,295 --> 00:53:36,546
where Ms. Na is?

671
00:53:39,257 --> 00:53:40,300
Yes, I do.

672
00:53:41,843 --> 00:53:42,969
Where did she go?

673
00:53:44,054 --> 00:53:47,974
Don't you think there's a reason
she didn't tell you?

674
00:53:55,273 --> 00:53:56,608
Mr. Ji Eun-ho,

675
00:53:57,567 --> 00:53:58,652
please.

676
00:54:00,654 --> 00:54:02,489
Tell me where she is.

677
00:54:11,289 --> 00:54:13,541
I really don't want to tell you.

678
00:54:16,127 --> 00:54:19,589
But the look on your face is the same one
she had when I last saw her.

679
00:54:20,590 --> 00:54:22,175
So I'll go ahead and tell you.

680
00:54:25,428 --> 00:54:29,516
She went to her parents' place in Daejeon
with her sister Ji-hye.

681
00:54:30,183 --> 00:54:33,770
I heard it from Ms. Cho,
her best friend, so it's probably true.

682
00:54:44,656 --> 00:54:45,573
Come in.

683
00:54:46,157 --> 00:54:46,992
Bo-bae.

684
00:54:47,575 --> 00:54:48,702
Bo-bae!

685
00:54:48,785 --> 00:54:50,537
Mom! Dad!

686
00:54:50,620 --> 00:54:54,291
Oh my! It's our sweet little Bo-bae!

687
00:54:59,504 --> 00:55:01,840
-That's enough.
-You're such a big girl now.

688
00:55:02,507 --> 00:55:04,968
What brings you here?
You didn't even call.

689
00:55:05,051 --> 00:55:08,054
Yong-gi mentioned you got a contract.
Didn't it work out?

690
00:55:08,138 --> 00:55:11,516
I'm just here 'cause I missed you guys.

691
00:55:12,267 --> 00:55:14,436
Did you really come just to see us?

692
00:55:15,020 --> 00:55:17,480
-You can't even look me in the eye.
-No, really.

693
00:55:17,564 --> 00:55:19,274
And I wanted to see Yong-gi's dojo.

694
00:55:19,357 --> 00:55:21,860
Where is it?
I'll stop by and see how he's doing.

695
00:55:21,943 --> 00:55:25,405
On the second floor of the building
where we used to live. Great spot.

696
00:55:25,488 --> 00:55:27,198
I'll be back. Let's talk later.

697
00:55:27,282 --> 00:55:29,993
-All right. Come back soon.
-Let's talk later!

698
00:55:32,078 --> 00:55:32,912
What's with her?

699
00:55:32,996 --> 00:55:35,206
Her face says it all. Something's up.

700
00:55:35,290 --> 00:55:36,249
What is it? Tell us.

701
00:55:38,501 --> 00:55:39,669
Well?

702
00:55:41,463 --> 00:55:42,881
Don't ask.

703
00:55:43,381 --> 00:55:46,593
Three, four, five, six, seven, switch.

704
00:55:46,676 --> 00:55:49,220
Two, two, three, four,

705
00:55:49,304 --> 00:55:52,098
five, six, seven, eight!

706
00:55:52,182 --> 00:55:53,558
Hand on your knee. Short.

707
00:55:53,641 --> 00:55:58,271
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, switch.

708
00:55:58,355 --> 00:55:59,647
What?

709
00:55:59,731 --> 00:56:01,775
How long has it been
since her power went away?

710
00:56:01,858 --> 00:56:03,777
I have a bad feeling about this.

711
00:56:03,860 --> 00:56:05,862
What if something bad happens?

712
00:56:10,367 --> 00:56:12,827
Four, five, six, seven, switch.

713
00:56:12,911 --> 00:56:15,622
Two, two, three, four,

714
00:56:15,705 --> 00:56:18,375
five, six, seven, eight!

715
00:56:18,458 --> 00:56:19,334
Waist circles.

716
00:56:19,417 --> 00:56:21,920
One, two, three, four,

717
00:56:22,003 --> 00:56:24,255
five, six, seven, the other way.

718
00:56:24,339 --> 00:56:26,758
Two, two, three, four,

719
00:56:26,841 --> 00:56:29,427
five, six, seven, eight!

720
00:56:29,511 --> 00:56:31,471
-What's going on?
-Shake your hands.

721
00:56:34,599 --> 00:56:36,643
-What's happening?
-Why is it flickering?

722
00:56:37,477 --> 00:56:38,937
Why's it flickering?

723
00:56:39,020 --> 00:56:40,188
What's happening?

724
00:56:41,189 --> 00:56:42,399
No.

725
00:56:43,775 --> 00:56:44,692
Here we go again.

726
00:56:45,693 --> 00:56:47,153
It's happening again.

727
00:56:49,239 --> 00:56:51,324
My curse that destroys everything.

728
00:57:32,615 --> 00:57:33,950
And now…

729
00:57:37,203 --> 00:57:41,040
the person I want to protect the most
from this curse

730
00:57:42,459 --> 00:57:44,461
is standing right in front of me.

731
00:59:37,782 --> 00:59:42,412
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
